//orb 3
Narrator: Now, you’ll cease to exist in records. Turned into the very kind of monster your island was blessed to be void of.
Young Noelle: <i>How do we escape the floods?</i>
Mother: <i>We build arks — dozens of them.</i> 
Young Noelle: <i>Does the giant monster cause floods because it’s evil?</i> 
Mother: <i>Most creatures are wild, dangerous things.</i>
Mother: <i>Which is why we never leave our Island of Dusk.</i> 
Narrator: You’ve only seen drawings of such creatures in books; <i>animals,</i> as they were also called, with threatening features and the ability to speak like humans do. 
Narrator: And now… you are neither. A hybrid of the two more monstrous than the imagination.
